{%- set orgName = content.header.logoLine1 + " " + content.header.logoLine2 -%}
{% include "site-header.njk" %}

<section class="bg-stone py-20">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-forest text-4xl lg:text-5xl leading-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="divider mt-6 mb-6 mx-auto"></div>
    <p class="text-gray-600">Last updated: October 2026</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-white py-16">
  <div class="privacy max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

    <p>
      This policy explains how {{ orgName }} ("we", "us") collects and uses personal information through this
      website, and your rights over it. It covers the website only. Information shared in counselling sessions
      is handled separately and in strict confidence, in line with BACP ethical guidelines.
    </p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      {{ orgName }} is the data controller for information collected through this website. You can contact us
      about anything in this policy at <a href="mailto:{{ content.contact.email }}">{{ content.contact.email }}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect and why</h2>
    <h3>Enquiry form</h3>
    <p>
      When you send an enquiry we collect your name, email address, your message, and anything else you choose
      to give us (such as a phone number, the service you're interested in, or how you heard about us). We use it
      only to reply to your enquiry and, if you go ahead, to arrange our services.
    </p>
    <h3>Cost calculator</h3>
    <p>
      The calculator works entirely in your browser. The numbers you type into it are not sent to us or stored
      anywhere unless you choose to request the full breakdown.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you request the full breakdown, we collect your name, email address, organisation (if given), the
      figures you entered and the resulting estimate, and whether you'd like to talk to us about training. We use
      this to provide the breakdown and, if you've asked us to, to get in touch about training. We won't add you to
      a mailing list.
    </p>

    <h2>Our legal basis</h2>
    <p>
      We rely on your <strong>consent</strong>, which you give by ticking the box on each form. You can withdraw
      it at any time by emailing us, and we will delete your details. Where you go on to use our services, we
      also process your information to take steps at your request before entering into a contract with you.
    </p>

    <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
    <p>
      We never sell your information or share it with third parties for marketing. We use a small number of
      service providers to run the website:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Formspree</strong> receives form submissions and forwards them to us by email. Formspree is based in the United States, so your information may be transferred there; Formspree states that it protects such transfers with appropriate safeguards.</li>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts the website and, like any web host, processes technical information such as your IP address to deliver pages and protect the site. We also use <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> to count how many people visit each page. It doesn't use cookies, doesn't identify you, and doesn't follow you around other websites; we only see totals.</li>
      <li><strong>Google Fonts, Tailwind CSS and unpkg</strong> supply the site's fonts, styling and icons. Your browser requests these directly, which shares your IP address with those providers.</li>
      <li><strong>YouTube</strong>: podcast videos load only if you press play, using YouTube's privacy-enhanced mode.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>
      We keep enquiries and calculator requests for up to two years from our last contact with you, then delete
      them. If you become a client, records are kept as required by our professional obligations.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This website does not set advertising or tracking cookies. The calculator remembers, for the rest of your
      visit only, that you've already requested the breakdown, using your browser's session storage; this is
      cleared when you close the tab.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under UK data protection law you have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>ask for a copy of the information we hold about you;</li>
      <li>ask us to correct or delete it;</li>
      <li>object to or ask us to restrict how we use it;</li>
      <li>withdraw your consent at any time.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      To use any of these rights, email <a href="mailto:{{ content.contact.email }}">{{ content.contact.email }}</a>.
      We'll respond within one month.
    </p>

    <h2>Complaints</h2>
    <p>
      If you're unhappy with how we've handled your information, please tell us first so we can put it right.
      You also have the right to complain to the Information Commissioner's Office (ICO) at
      <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a> or on 0303 123 1113.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>
  </div>
</section>

